generation contact

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:01.912
center, which we're
going to show you

00:13:01.912 --> 00:13:03.227
in a couple of minutes.

00:13:03.227 --> 00:13:05.560
And then actually getting
that in front of our customers

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:07.900
really quickly, and getting
end users' feedback,

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:10.210
and then iterating over that.

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:11.998
MICHAEL RAMOS: So
the development team,

00:13:11.998 --> 00:13:13.540
