00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:21.670
Hopefully, you're leaning
in heavily on design methods

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:24.760
and methodologies, such as human
centered user centric design.

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:27.250
That way, you're working with
a team who really understands

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.060
that problem they've given you.

