00:13:46.657 --> 00:13:48.240
We want to be fit
for federal in terms

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:50.910
of compliance, current
systems, current solutions,

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:52.380
and integrations.

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:55.110
Then we can move into
our layer of usability.

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:59.000
And OK, well, is what
we're going to build,

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.730
is it going to be usable?

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:03.827
Again, in the context of
federal, it's pretty important.

00:14:03.827 --> 00:14:05.910
And then useful, this is
where we get to have fun.

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:07.680
All right, how can
we add some spice?

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:10.080
How can we add some
pizzazz and really make

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:13.210
any solution we develop
within two weeks cool?

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:16.690
And then with that on top,
