with a solution.

00:14:20.430 --> 00:14:22.770
And if we're providing
any type of solution that

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:25.470
makes the mission more
efficient for our end users,

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:27.390
hopefully, that provides
